Put the @0% fat plain yoghurt{200%ml} into a small bowl. Squeeze the @cucumber piece{140%g}(grated) to remove excess liquid, then add to the yoghurt with the @garlic{1%clove}(finely grated), @mint leaves{2%tbsp}(finely chopped), @sea salt{pinch}, and @?sweetener{pinch}. Mix well. Serve with @./Savoury/Baked Falafel{}.